{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Push crates! Attack chooks! Dodgeroll on the floor laughing!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This solo-developed love letter to <i><strong>Monkey Island, Chip\u2019s Challenge, Zelda</strong> </i>and Power Metal is like a lost DS gem.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Box pushing, boulder rolling, lock-and-key grid puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is it\u2019s own super grid puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An absurdly funny, unique story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sharp combat with customisable difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens and dozens of secrets, collectables and mind-bending puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16-bit soundtrack inspired by F-Zero and 90\u2019s games guitar soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completely custom retro engine technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3-4 hours of gameplay in a tiny, tiny, 30mb download</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Redeem your birthright (maybe)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat the Blacklord (even maybier)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>When a blacksmith\u2019s birthright is stolen by evil Blacklords, he must draw upon the might of some sword he found..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It matters not that he knows not what any of it is \u2014all he knows is that his new Sword has a power that is apparent and indisputable. Is it the power to slice? To dice, cut things, or be sheathed? He\u2019ll need to find out if he\u2019s to bring the Blacklord to justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This absurd comedy adventure\u2019s entire <strong>game</strong> <strong>engine</strong>, code, art, story, and soundtrack <strong>were custom made by one guy </strong>to<strong> </strong>give the look and feel of a<strong> missing gem from the early 00\u2019s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s full of puzzles, chuckles, and tough combat. Or cruisy combat, if you\u2019d prefer. It\u2019s the perfect way to spend a lazy Sunday afternoon or an intense Sunday evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The new version, <i>The Extended Edition</i>, brings a nearly twice-as-big world with tonnes of extra puzzles, secrets, enemies, jokes, story elements, quality-of-life improvements, movement and combat tweaks, and improvements to graphics and sound.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pre-Storm Clam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/7ad8f8f2814c7a66153df45122f30fde153f46b0.jpg"},{"name":"Questgiver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/1f01a5f803370646ce388563b3da424f2f491341.jpg"},{"name":"Party Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/4d841f819e67e83665a3d8db33e6ba48c889ca92.jpg"},{"name":"Untwisted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/5b0bba7846fd8e0fd2c87d34554ad159a713c829.jpg"},{"name":"Second Verse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/35ebf561a952cca359b2b947629a9b726a92c493.jpg"},{"name":"Hot and Cold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/78f64a6143fbf09c88fd98d0133eccf9951e9c17.jpg"},{"name":"Remarkable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/5e4627de8a571c2eb5c8eebd559fa4d6160de524.jpg"},{"name":"Open The Gate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/dd4e1260b05abfb8602a75a37ea6091651b37618.jpg"},{"name":"Cunning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/bfd08488ca9c007ed2127443494862592642750e.jpg"},{"name":"Stunning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2333130/0cc07b117474ff12ff3279f4c8606b7afe3b20fa.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2333130?t=1746103886","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333130/ad7cdb84945bd7065ba4a7b7db741c39ad73318a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746103886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333130/e91ce557ac76705f363384abfd8f3a5edaa7758c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746103886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333130/e91ce557ac76705f363384abfd8f3a5edaa7758c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746103886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Push crates! Attack chooks! Dodgeroll on the floor laughing!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This solo-developed love letter to <i><strong>Monkey Island, Chip\u2019s Challenge, Zelda</strong> </i>and Power Metal is like a lost DS gem.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Box pushing, boulder rolling, lock-and-key grid puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is it\u2019s own super grid puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An absurdly funny, unique story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sharp combat with customisable difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens and dozens of secrets, collectables and mind-bending puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16-bit soundtrack inspired by F-Zero and 90\u2019s games guitar soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completely custom retro engine technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3-4 hours of gameplay in a tiny, tiny, 30mb download</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Redeem your birthright (maybe)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat the Blacklord (even maybier)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>When a blacksmith\u2019s birthright is stolen by evil Blacklords, he must draw upon the might of some sword he found..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It matters not that he knows not what any of it is \u2014all he knows is that his new Sword has a power that is apparent and indisputable. Is it the power to slice? To dice, cut things, or be sheathed? He\u2019ll need to find out if he\u2019s to bring the Blacklord to justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This absurd comedy adventure\u2019s entire <strong>game</strong> <strong>engine</strong>, code, art, story, and soundtrack <strong>were custom made by one guy </strong>to<strong> </strong>give the look and feel of a<strong> missing gem from the early 00\u2019s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s full of puzzles, chuckles, and tough combat. Or cruisy combat, if you\u2019d prefer. It\u2019s the perfect way to spend a lazy Sunday afternoon or an intense Sunday evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The new version, <i>The Extended Edition</i>, brings a nearly twice-as-big world with tonnes of extra puzzles, secrets, enemies, jokes, story elements, quality-of-life improvements, movement and combat tweaks, and improvements to graphics and sound.</p>","developers":["Dale Blackwood"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333130/3fb0f072dd4dcb710c0cd95d249bdb0ef3447880/header.jpg?t=1746103886","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requir